<title>JAPAN: BOJ's Matsushita attends parliament panel Tuesday.</title>
<headline>BOJ's Matsushita attends parliament panel Tuesday.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of Japan (BOJ) Governor Yasuo Matsushita will attend the Upper House finance committee on Tuesday from 10 a.m. to 5 p.m. (0100 to 0800 GMT) to reply to questions from committee members, the central bank said in a statement.</p>
</text>
